subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Show price change history for a subscription

USAGE:
  subtrack history <OPTIONS> [<id>]

ARGUMENTS:
  id           Subscription ID

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help             Display this help message
  -v, --version          Display this version
  --all                  Show all price changes across all subscriptions
  --days <days>          Filter to recent N days (used with --all)
  -j, --json             Output as JSON

